function.\\nIVIMFunction[components, type] gives the IVIM function. \
\\n\\ntype can be \\\"Normal\\\" or \\\"Exp\\\".\\ncomponenets can be 2 or 3.\
\\n\\noutput is the function with b, S0, f1, f2, D, pD1, pD2 as parameters. \
