of the spin system din given the hamiltonian H using ex Degree exitation and \
ref Degree refocus pulses and b1.\\nThe te is defined in ms, the ex and ref \
are defined in degree and b1 of 100% is defined as 1. \\nThe output is a new \
spinsystem dout.\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
             StripOnInput->False,
             LineSpacing->{1.5, 1.5, 3.}],
